  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織！　お疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001025010020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "レッスン終わりましたので、\r\n鍵を返却します",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102501/4001025010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、戸締まりは大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001025010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。窓の鍵、各種電源、照明、エアコン、\r\n全て問題ありません",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102501/4001025010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすがだな、ありがとう\r\n今日のレッスンはどうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001025010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。新しい曲の振り付けを習いました\r\n今日は頭から１サビまで",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102501/4001025010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001025010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "難しい部分もありましたので\r\n完璧ではありませんが……今のところ順調です",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
